  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **Marble Tulip Juicy Tree** (1 other source): A tape flip occurs in the middle of this song [1]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Strap On That Jammypac (lounge version)**: rare: 14 archived performances [3]\n- **Lovin' You Through it All**: mythic rare: 2 archived performances [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **ween1995-02-05.fixed** (recommended): audience recording; 29 songs; 136 min; rated 4/5 by 1 [1]. Said about its sound: Tape flips interrupt the recording mid-song; the uploader's attempt to make them seamless was imperfect [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Reviewer attended, was on their feet throughout, then drove about two hours south of St. Petersburg afterward [2]\n- Reviewer's earlier Ween shows ran only about an hour and a half, unlike this longer one [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **ween1995-02-05.fixed**: taped by Unknown; transferred by Josh Keats; source: Unk Aud [1]. Also: Recorded by an attendee on a Sony D-3 cassette deck using a Sony 909 microphone and Maxell Metal tape [2]",
